<title>ITALY: Manuli Rubber MRIMI makes firm Milan bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Manuli Rubber MRIMI makes firm Milan bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Manuli Rubber Industries started trading on the Milan bourse on Friday with an opening price of 6,100 lire, nearly eight percent up on its 5,650 lire flotation price.</p>
<p>The company's placement had closed with demand for almost seven times the total 26 million shares on offer. The stock had been quoted on the London grey market at around 6,000 lire.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
